From 00808c1710812d42d27d17012086c7ae69988626 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Sat, 21 Feb 2026 23:34:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] Rename Projector to Tank8849 and update all identifiers

Rename all classes, files, preference keys, array resources, and log
messages from Projector/projector_ to Tank8849/tank8849_. The menu
entry is now labeled "8849" instead of "Projector".

Sysfs hardware paths (projector_sys_status, projector_rgb_current, etc.)
are left unchanged as they are kernel-defined.
